{
  "id": "dialogue.hiori.gift",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "幸福に満ちる",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hiori.gift",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hiori.gift",
    "idolId": "hiori",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这个嘛……",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "对我来说，最能让你发光的东西，是灯织自己喜欢的东西。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "我自己喜欢的……吗。原来如此，还有这种想法。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，换个角度看看。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "可是……我喜欢的那些东西，真的找得到吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "别露出那种表情。难得出来，就享受一下吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，那边的摊子也去看看吧？说不定有和之前不一样的东西。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "好，我去稍微看看。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "怎么样？有找到喜欢的吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "每一个都很好看，但要说喜欢的话……果然还是很难。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……制作人在这之中，最喜欢哪一个？",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我想想……这边这些镶诞生石的怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "诞生石……原来如此。我是 3 月 4 日……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "就是这个镶了蓝色石头的发夹。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "哇……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "喜欢吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……不，只是稍微有点在意而已。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "能遇到在意的东西，就已经很不错了。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "那……好吧，确实是这样。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "听说诞生石还能当护身符。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……是这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……我决定了。就买这个。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "非常感谢，制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她看起来很高兴……带她来是对的。）",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "方便的话，现在就戴上让我看看？",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……那就。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "我戴在后面了……感觉，怎么样？",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "很适合你",
            "nextNodeId": "2-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "很像灯织",
            "nextNodeId": "3-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "expression",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "和服装也搭",
            "nextNodeId": "4-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "sharedStat",
                "stat": "stress",
                "delta": -2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……制作人，这边。",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "明明是我约的，让你等了，抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "不会。既然是要找和我的服装相配的小饰物，一起过来是当然的。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（其实是想让灯织放松一下……不过这么说她一定会拒绝。）",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那，我们出发吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "好。那么，走吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "怎么样？跑了几家，有找到合适的吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……没有。哪一个都差一点。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "所谓\"像偶像的小饰物\"……到底是什么样的东西呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "2-01": {
        "id": "2-01",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……谢、谢谢您。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-02"
      },
      "2-02": {
        "id": "2-02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样一来，舞台上的灯织会更耀眼。"
      },
      "3-01": {
        "id": "3-01",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "像我……？怎么说呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "3-02"
      },
      "3-02": {
        "id": "3-02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。那清澈的蓝色很漂亮，和灯织给人的感觉正好相合。"
      },
      "4-01": {
        "id": "4-01",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "这样啊。那么，选了它真是太好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-02"
      },
      "4-02": {
        "id": "4-02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。两个人转了一圈，没有白费。"
      }
    }
  },
